Set field values for multiple items at once

**Permissions Required:** bulk_edit_items

**Example:**
```json
{
  "item_codes": ["ITEM001", "ITEM002", "ITEM003"],
  "field_values": {
    "warranty_period": "2 years",
    "supplier": "ABC Corp"
  }
}
```

get.description:
